Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:09.49,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:18.99,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Dear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.53,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,If it isn't Aldous Clayton.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:25.66,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,You know, from the Mayflower Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:30.08,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,What?! {\i1}That{\i0} Aldous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:36.01,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,I would've let you be\Nif you were none the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:41.51,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,I mean, you look about \Nas foolish as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:45.49,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,How right you are! \NWhat a complete fool I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:21.88,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:25.87,Main - Top,Aldous,0,0,0,,Folkvangr, the House of Plenty,\Non Rosenkreuz street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.87,0:02:28.46,Main - Top,Gentleman,0,0,0,,What love I'll make to you, my pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.90,0:02:28.63,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,Isn't this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:30.15,Main - Top,Prostitute,0,0,0,,Oh, you. Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.87,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,...the infamous high-class brothel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.87,0:02:35.62,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I-Is he going to sell me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:42.88,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,So she realized your identity, and you \Nwere so shocked that you brought her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:47.64,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,You know how to make \Na darling little blunder, Rudy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:50.13,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,"R-Rudy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.69,0:02:52.63,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Abigail, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.63,0:02:55.35,Default,Miriam,0,0,0,,Abby's the mistress of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:57.65,Default,Miriam,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Rebekah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:03:01.22,Default,Rebekah,0,0,0,,She's the {\i1}owner{\i0}. \NYou're such an idiot, Miriam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.65,Default,Miriam,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:08.65,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,If I'm the mistress here, then I suppose \Nthat makes Rudy my guard dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:14.32,Default,Miriam,0,0,0,,Oh, and the Mayflower Company\N where Aldous works belongs to Abby too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:18.28,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,Well, I'm an investor there,\N to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:23.43,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,Now, what about that man? \NDid you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:26.56,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,I shot him in the leg, \Nand it didn't so much as faze him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:30.12,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,He was a trained soldier, \Nnot just any dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:31.76,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,He was a dealer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.76,0:03:36.49,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,Yeah. He was selling \Nsome nasty drugs around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.49,0:03:39.00,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,What would a man like that want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.44,Default,Aldous,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:43.68,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,Was it something I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:47.01,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,He recognized Lady Lily's spell, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.66,0:03:49.02,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:52.21,Default,Guard,0,0,0,,We cannot allow you beyond this point!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:55.95,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Your Lordship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:04.02,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:08.47,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I heard that my Constance Grail\N was in your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.47,0:04:10.58,Default,Abigail,0,0,0,,Gracious. {\i1}Your{\i0} Constance?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.25,0:04:21.28,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,An abandoned carriage, \Na corpse with gunshot wounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:23.48,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,You can see why I feared the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:25.24,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:31.16,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,You needn't apologize. I doubt there \Nwas anything you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.12,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,However, in future,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:38.62,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it if you informed me \Nbefore taking any initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:40.62,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.77,0:04:43.22,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Scarlett?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:46.58,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:50.27,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'm just sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:53.91,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I suppose this is what I get\N for using that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:57.24,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I'm going to rest awhile...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:08.54,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Randolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:11.61,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Excuse him. He's a colleague of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.66,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:15.36,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,I've come to tell you \Nwe'll be working late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:17.89,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,It's about the body of \Nthe coachman who was shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.17,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,He had a sun tattoo \Non the nape of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:23.71,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,A sun tattoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:25.19,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Do you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:28.45,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I'm sure I've seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:29.81,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,It was, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.12,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,It was on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.81,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,The woman who collapsed \Nat the masquerade ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.73,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Kiara Grafton!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.46,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Huh? Kiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:45.83,Default,Kyle,0,0,0,,Gaina didn't mention that in his report.\N Damn that bungler!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:49.83,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me, but I think Scarlett...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:52.83,Flashback,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Why, this takes me back. That's Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.27,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,...called her "Jane."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:59.45,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Did she have a sweet smell about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.45,0:06:02.46,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I believe she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:07.11,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,That's Jackal's Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.69,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,A potent hallucinogen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:15.25,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,It was known as "Jane" in certain circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:17.02,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,A hallucinogen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:23.24,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Aldous said that the coachman \Nwho attacked me was a drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.24,0:06:26.40,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,And he had a sun tattoo \Nas well, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:30.74,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:36.09,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,A vast criminal syndicate \Nwe've been pursuing for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:43.01,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Murder, kidnapping, human trafficking, \Nhallucinogen smuggling...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.01,0:06:47.30,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,It's said they belong to no nation \Nand will do anything for the right price.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.83,0:06:50.60,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,The syndicate's name is Daeg Gallus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.91,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,It means "the rooster that crows at dawn."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:59.31,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:02.56,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't illegal ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.56,0:07:06.23,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Though I can't say it ever agreed with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.23,0:07:08.78,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,At least she's back \Nto her usual self after a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.56,Default,Marta,0,0,0,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:14.58,Default,Marta,0,0,0,,Miss Kate Lorraine has come calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.43,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:26.75,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,A messenger from the Grail house \Ncame to us last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:30.21,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,saying that you hadn't come home \Nand asking if we knew anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.23,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Tell me, Connie...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.62,0:07:36.13,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,What on earth \Nhave you gotten yourself into?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.05,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Is it dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.05,0:07:41.02,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,If so, then just give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:46.49,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,I can't tell her! It's deadly dangerous, \Nbut Kate's the last person I could tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:48.97,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Why won't you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.97,0:07:52.15,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Not a word about your engagement, \Nand now not a word about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.86,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Please, tell me why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:08:00.87,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.25,0:08:04.96,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,If that's all you came to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.43,0:08:07.96,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,then... go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.99,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Wait! Think of the risk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.99,0:08:43.06,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Even so!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:54.88,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:02.31,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,"Come alone to the shore \Nof Lake Bernadia at noon tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.64,0:09:08.04,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Don't breathe a word to anyone. \NIf you miss our appointment...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:13.40,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,we'll send you a finger next."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:22.74,Default,Shoshanna,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Salvador!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:26.75,Default,Shoshanna,0,0,0,,What's that big thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:29.24,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Got you a souvenir, Shoshanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.01,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,SEVENTH PRINCE OF FARIS\NULYSSES FARIS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:39.01,Default,Shoshanna,0,0,0,,Really, Salvador!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.87,0:09:42.19,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Look after him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.08,0:09:53.35,Default,José,0,0,0,,Kate Lorraine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:58.54,Default,José,0,0,0,,Tell me. Where's Lily Orlamunde's key?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.54,Default,José,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb. \NI know Constance Grail had it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.54,0:10:10.29,Main - Italics,Kate,0,0,0,,So that's it. He's after Connie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.29,0:10:11.37,Default,José,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:13.80,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,I've never heard of any such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.80,0:10:17.40,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't tell you even if I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:22.90,Default,José,0,0,0,,You little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:24.37,Main - Top,Salvador,0,0,0,,Ugh, how revolting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:26.81,Default,José,0,0,0,,Salvador?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:32.36,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Tell me, José. Your job\N is to sell Paradise, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.81,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,So who said you could pull this stunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:38.83,Default,José,0,0,0,,L-Looking for the key's\N part of our job too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:42.63,Default,José,0,0,0,,My partner was following a lead\Non it and got bumped off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.63,0:10:45.57,Default,José,0,0,0,,The moment he touched Constance Grail!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:48.32,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.83,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.59,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Consider yourself warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.05,0:10:57.46,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Clean up your own mess later, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.43,0:11:01.94,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Do you resent Constance Grail?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:04.60,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,No, not one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:10.85,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Meeting her was \Nthe best fortune I've ever had,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:16.03,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,and I've never been prouder of anything \Nthan I am of being her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:19.26,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Resent her? You must be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:21.64,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:27.63,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,You're not coming, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:32.62,Signs,Signs,0,0,0,,11 YEARS AGO, WINTER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:32.62,Flashback,Kate's Mother,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, dear. \NI know it's your first real party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:34.62,Flashback,Kate's Mother,0,0,0,,To make it up to you... Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.49,0:11:37.37,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,Special occasion cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.38,Flashback,Kate's Mother,0,0,0,,Make lots of friends, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.46,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:47.00,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,Miss Pamela Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:51.30,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,Thank you ever so much \Nfor inviting me toda—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.15,Flashback - Top,Young Pamela,0,0,0,,You stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.39,Flashback,Young Pamela,0,0,0,,You stink to high heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:57.41,Flashback,Young Pamela,0,0,0,,Oh, what a horrible smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:59.64,Flashback - Top,Girls,0,0,0,,Maybe you smell the commoner on her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.08,0:12:00.45,Flashback,Girls,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.09,Flashback - Top,Girls,0,0,0,,She does reek.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.90,Flashback,Girls,0,0,0,,Say, isn't her mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:06.68,Flashback,Young Pamela,0,0,0,,You there. You think so too, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:10.83,Flashback,Young Pamela,0,0,0,,Doesn't that girl smell just awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:16.05,Flashback,Young Connie,0,0,0,,She doesn't smell bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:21.60,Flashback,Young Connie,0,0,0,,Actually, she smells like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:23.42,Flashback,Young Connie,0,0,0,,I know! Cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:29.01,Flashback,Girls,0,0,0,,Miss Pamela!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.35,Flashback,Girls,0,0,0,,Please wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:37.93,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:39.69,Flashback,Young Connie,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:47.19,Flashback,Young Connie,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:53.32,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,Um, I'm Kate. Kate Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:56.60,Flashback,Young Kate,0,0,0,,I'm Connie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:04.93,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.19,0:13:11.22,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:18.09,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I can't just sit here and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:19.56,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:25.02,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,And here I thought you'd do as you're told\N like a naive little simpleton again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:31.77,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Miss Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.24,0:13:36.15,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Your Lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:39.01,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,You look pale. Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.01,0:13:41.00,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.00,0:13:43.59,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I wanted to put something to Scarlett.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:48.51,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Was anyone else at that ball \Nusing Jackal's Paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:50.27,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:52.74,Flashback,Scarlett,0,0,0,,"Don't breathe a word to anyone."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:57.13,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:58.52,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:04.65,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,I want to tell His Lordship, \Nbut if I do, what about Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:08.03,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Norman Holden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:14.51,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I think he was there too, \Nand he had quite the Jane habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:18.03,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,She, uh, says that \Nthere was a Norman Holden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:21.50,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,She's certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.85,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:26.21,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I see. I'll look into him, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.23,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:37.16,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,I got her involved in \Nthe worst way possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.94,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm certain our friendship \Nwill never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.86,0:14:45.08,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.06,Default,Ruffian A,0,0,0,,Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.90,0:14:56.12,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:01.20,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Why did you come, you dunderhead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.79,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Why? It's my fault you—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:07.38,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,I don't {\i1}want{\i0} to be saved\N if it comes at your expense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:12.35,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Honestly...\NYou never think things through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.97,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,You're not cross with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:22.72,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I came alone like you asked,\N so let Kate go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.22,Default,José,0,0,0,,Take her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.76,0:15:27.73,Default,José,0,0,0,,Make sure you finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.83,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.86,Default,José,0,0,0,,Can't have her talking, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.63,0:15:35.86,Default,José,0,0,0,,And dead girls tell no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.39,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.00,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.00,0:15:41.52,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Constance Grail!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.45,0:15:46.09,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Follow your own path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.65,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.67,Main - Top,Ruffian B,0,0,0,,Hey! Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:52.13,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.11,0:15:54.86,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,This isn't what you promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:57.04,Default,José,0,0,0,,Sorry, little lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:01.39,Default,José,0,0,0,,but it's your own fault\N for falling for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.45,0:16:05.87,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,No! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.87,0:16:07.90,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate! Kate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.38,Main - Top,Ruffians,0,0,0,,Pipe down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:08.66,Main - Top,Ruffians,0,0,0,,Quit struggling!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.01,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Stop that man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.66,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'll tell you everything! \NI'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.66,0:16:15.64,Default,José,0,0,0,,The other girl kept a cooler head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:18.16,Default,José,0,0,0,,She was prepared for the worst all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.16,0:16:20.90,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,No... Kate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.44,0:16:22.40,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Ka—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:36.17,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:40.41,Default,José,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:42.53,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:50.56,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Your Lordship...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:53.69,Default,José,0,0,0,,No way! The Security Force?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.69,0:16:54.44,Default,José,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:58.70,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I regret to inform you we've already \Narrested your friends in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:01.46,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,Then Kate must be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:03.63,Default,José,0,0,0,,Damn it! You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:05.96,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,Oh, do forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.58,0:17:10.86,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,But it's your own fault \Nfor falling for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:17.54,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Earl Norman Holden\N passed away 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.54,0:17:19.36,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,He couldn't have attended that ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:23.63,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,He was an old coot whose hobby was \Npreaching the goddesses' word at people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:27.14,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,One day, someone flew \Ninto a rage over it and killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:28.49,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,His last words were...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.49,0:17:31.49,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,"O gods, save me!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:35.39,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,So you gave me his name\Nto send His Lordship a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.99,0:17:38.98,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Thank you, Scarlett.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:44.64,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,Moreover, as I've already told you, \Nyou're hopeless at lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.14,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:47.79,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,What are you apologizing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:51.26,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,For, um, worrying you, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.00,0:17:56.46,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Er, you weren't worried \Nabout me at all, I'm sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:17:59.50,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I mean, you were merely doing your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:03.02,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,How silly of me! I just got \Ncarried away and wasn't thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.02,0:18:04.21,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:08.78,Default,Randolph,0,0,0,,I was worried, was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.90,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,Does he mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.90,0:18:13.31,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.31,0:18:16.27,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,This emotionless, stick-in-the-mud\N blockhead actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:18.32,Default,Security Force A,0,0,0,,Beg pardon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:21.96,Default,Security Force A,0,0,0,,The infirmary just finished \Ntreating Miss Kate Lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:24.08,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I-I'll be right with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:28.20,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Where to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.43,Main - Italics,Connie,0,0,0,,Amelia Hobbes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.08,0:18:36.37,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,"Time and again,\N Miss C strikes out alone!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:38.29,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,"Where could her trail lead?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.07,0:18:41.31,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Only joking. Today, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.43,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'm here to ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.43,0:18:47.01,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Crown Princess Cecilia has taken \Na liking to you, hasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:48.89,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,No, I'd hardly say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:52.32,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,I've got a scoop so big,\N it could shake the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:57.61,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Crown Princess Cecilia... has the blood \Nof a prostitute in her veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.32,0:19:01.61,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Unbelievable, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:05.82,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Her family, the Luzes, are a proper line\N of blue-blooded viscounts, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:11.83,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,But I got a tip that their family register\N shows signs of tampering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:16.57,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Viscount Luze had a daughter\N with his wife, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:20.77,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,But, apparently, the girl died \Nin an epidemic quite some time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:24.34,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,I bet {\i1}she{\i0} was the one \Nwith the weak constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:28.91,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Turns out the viscount\N had another daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:33.38,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Although her rose-red eyes \Nproved she was of Luze blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:38.36,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,he'd given her to an orphanage \Nbecause her mother was only his mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:45.11,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,They say this girl and a boy at \Nthe same orphanage swore eternal love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:48.01,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,His name was... Oh, right. Cici.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:54.05,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,The crown princess often slips out of the \Npalace to visit the people of the slums.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:56.38,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,It's famously proof of her virtue...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:20:00.88,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,But what if she's really been \Nrendezvousing with her old lover?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.36,0:20:07.38,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Too bad my source went \Nand turned into a drug addict on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.71,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Remember Teresa Jennings, \Nwho killed herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:12.23,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,Her husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.64,0:20:14.20,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Drugs...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.20,0:20:18.92,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,So, now I need a new helper \Nwho can get close to the crown princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:21.41,Default,Amelia,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, \Nmy sincere Miss Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:23.06,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Wait just a—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.12,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Scarlett, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.55,Default,Scarlett,0,0,0,,It's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:36.92,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Connie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:39.63,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Kate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:42.47,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Thank goodness! Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.93,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,I guess I made it out, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.43,0:20:50.61,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Kate. \NYou must have been terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.61,0:20:54.04,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,I'm so, so very...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:55.43,Default,Kate,0,0,0,,Connie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.85,0:20:59.29,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,Listen, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:03.66,Default,Connie,0,0,0,,There's something I want you to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:10.95,Default,José,0,0,0,,Kiriki kirikuku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:13.21,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Lie low and stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.12,Default,José,0,0,0,,It's my lucky day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:18.32,Default,José,0,0,0,,Hurry up and untie me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.00,0:21:28.66,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Hi there, Cess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:30.46,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Or, given where we are, should I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.93,0:21:33.60,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Crown Princess Cecilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:36.47,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Out of my sight, merchant. You're barred.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:39.73,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Have a heart! You banned me \Nfrom the palace yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:41.72,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Now, about the abortion drug...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.72,0:21:45.99,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Who was it who assured me \Nits odor was too faint to detect?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.49,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Yes, that was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.49,0:21:51.88,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Well, why not take the chance \Nto bear the prince's child?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:55.16,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,The higher-ups have been pestering you \Nto have a kid, haven't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.77,0:21:59.00,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,It would be harder to get \Nanything done while carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:02.35,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Why do you think I ordered that medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.51,0:22:06.50,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,Well, no skin off my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.87,0:22:09.16,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,I hate using kids as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.60,0:22:11.34,Default,Cecilia,0,0,0,,Now, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:13.12,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,I have a message from headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.92,0:22:18.54,Default,Salvador,0,0,0,,We're resuming the Holy Grail of Eris.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:22.06,Signs,Signs; title,0,0,0,,AND THE COCK CROWS TO HERALD THE DAWN
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:28.12,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(480,524)\fs12\fnArial\c&H351F51&\3c&H9985A7&\blur1\shad0\pos(181.286,322)}Translation:\h\h\h\h\h\h\hWilliam Varteresian
